     "tipo": "explicacion",
     "titulo": "Demonstratives",
     "texto": [
      "**Ten** goes with masculine nouns, **ta** with feminine ones and **to** with neuter ones.",
      "Some forms change when the noun is the direct object: **ten zeszyt**, but **biorę ten zeszyt**; with a feminine noun: **ta sukienka**, **wybieram tę sukienkę**."
     ],
